1 नुद् नुद॑ति नुद॑˚ते pp. नुत्त॑ & नुन्न push,
thrust;
 impel, incite;
 expel, drive away, remove, reject. C. नोदयति
impel. I. नोनुद्यते drive away repeatedly, chase. —अप, व्यप, अपा &
व्यपा push or drive away, chase, remove. निस् push out, expel, remove,
reject. परा push away, chase, remove. प्र push or drive away,
chase;
 impel, incite. प्रति push back, repel, avert. वि drive
asunder or away;
 strike, wound. C. drive away, pass or spend (time);
divert, amuse;
 delight in, enjoy (instr.). सम् press or bring
together. C. bring near, fetch;
 impel, incite. उपसम् = prec. S.
